      "content": "it's a lot to take in... honestly it's kind of terrifying. i don't want to be a \"source of chaos\" or anything, i just want to finish my work without causing a scene or breaking something. if this really is a \"frequency\" coming from me, is there any way to actually stabilize it? like, are there techniques to help keep my energy contained so it doesn't leak out and mess with the office equipment every time i get stressed?",
